# textdomain: nc_api
(C)2018-@1 by Aaron Suen <warr1024@@gmail.com>=tenpo sike suno nanpa 2018-@1 la jan Aaron Suen <warr1024@@gmail.com> li pali li lawa e ijo ni
- "Furnaces" are not a thing; discover smelting with open flames.=- ona li ken ala pali e poki seli. o kama sona e nasin seli kepeken seli open.
- Aux+drop any item to drop everything.=- sina weka e ijo li kepeken lawa namako “Aux” la ijo ale li weka.
- Be wary of dark caves/chasms; you are responsible for getting yourself out.=- sina jo ala e nasin pi pali suno la o tawa ala lon lupa ma pimeja! sina lon lupa ma pimeja la, sina taso li ken kama sona e nasin weka.
- Can't dig trees or grass? Search for sticks in the canopy.=- sina ken ala pakala e kasi e ma kasi la o alasa e palisa mute lon lipu kasi.
- Climbing spots also produce very faint light; raise display gamma to see.=- kepeken pi tawa sewi sinpin li pana lili e suno. sina ken ala lukin e suno lili ni la o suli e suno pi ilo sitelen tawa kepeken nimi ante ni: "gamma".
- Climbing spots may be climbed once black particles appear.=- sinpin li pana e pipi lili pimeja mute la sina ken tawa sewi e sinpin.
- Crafting is done by building recipes in-world.=- nasin pali ale li lon ma.
- DONE: @1=- pini: @1
- Drop and pick up items to rearrange your inventory.=- sina wile ante e nasin pi ijo sina la o weka o kama jo e ijo sina.
- Drop items onto ground to create stack nodes. They do not decay.=- sina weka e ijo mute la ijo mute li lon ma li kama kulupu. tenpo kama la kulupu pi ijo mute li kama weka ala.
- FUTURE: @1=- tenpo kama la: @1
- For larger recipes, the center item is usually placed last.=- nasin pi pali ijo li suli la o pana e ijo pini lon insa.
- Hold/repeat right-click on walls/ceilings barehanded to create climbing spots.=- palisa luka teje sina li tawa lon nena teje li tawa mute anu awen la sina pali e kepeken sewi sinpin.
- If a recipe exists, you will see a special particle effect.=nasin pali li lon la leko li pana e pipi lili.
- Pay attention to the stars for long distance navigation.=sina wile sona e ma sina la o kepeken mun.
- Some recipes require "pummeling" a node.=nasin pali li ken kepeken luka mute.
- Stacks may be pummeled, exact item count may matter.=sina ken luka mute e kulupu. nanpa kulupu li ken suli.
- Stuck in something solid? Stand still and you will eventually teleport out.=sina lon ijo kiwen la o tawa ala. sina awen la sina weka lon tenpo kama.
- To pummel, punch a node repeatedly, WITHOUT digging.=sina wile luka mute la o luka sike e ijo li pakala ALA.
Active Lens=ilo suno wan open
